WEBVTT

00:01.930 --> 00:03.930
Previously on "Final Space"...

00:03.960 --> 00:05.350
At long last, Gary and Avocato

00:05.380 --> 00:07.040
rescue Avocato's son,
Little Cato,

00:07.070 --> 00:08.590
from the clutches
of the Lord Commander,

00:08.620 --> 00:10.180
but that dick weed
takes revenge

00:10.210 --> 00:13.390
and teleports a bomb that Avocato finds just in time

00:13.420 --> 00:16.560
to sacrifice his life
to save his son.

00:16.600 --> 00:20.020
♪♪

00:20.050 --> 00:22.400
I know.
I'll miss him, too.

00:22.430 --> 00:25.370
♪♪

00:25.400 --> 00:28.710
H.U.E.: You have three minutes
of oxygen left.

00:28.750 --> 00:31.200
It's cold, H.U.E.

00:31.230 --> 00:32.580
Are you cold?

00:32.610 --> 00:37.380
I only feel two things, Gary -- nothing and nothingness.

00:37.410 --> 00:39.520
You know what?

00:39.550 --> 00:41.380
It's the shade.

00:41.420 --> 00:45.390
It's always, like, 10 degrees
colder in the shade.

00:45.420 --> 00:48.280
Space is made
entirely of shade.

00:48.320 --> 00:49.910
Yeah, I guess it is.

00:49.940 --> 00:52.390
I gotta find some of
that non-shade.

00:52.430 --> 00:54.570
Where the hell is it?

00:54.600 --> 00:57.400
Oh, hey.

00:57.430 --> 00:58.880
Oh.[ Beeping ]

00:58.920 --> 01:01.750
Oh, boom -- non-shade.

01:01.780 --> 01:05.650
Crap! It's, like, really
freakin' piping hot now.

01:05.680 --> 01:14.550
♪♪

01:14.590 --> 01:23.420
♪♪

01:23.460 --> 01:32.330
♪♪

01:35.120 --> 01:41.440
♪♪

01:41.480 --> 01:47.860
♪♪

01:47.900 --> 01:49.930
Gary: Avocato?

01:49.970 --> 01:52.940
It's been three days
since you died.

01:52.970 --> 01:54.970
I have to say I'm...

01:55.010 --> 01:57.600
I'm struggling here, man.

01:57.630 --> 02:04.640
♪♪

02:04.670 --> 02:11.640
♪♪

02:11.680 --> 02:18.480
♪♪

02:18.510 --> 02:20.070
You said to
look after your boy,

02:20.100 --> 02:23.450
and I can barely
look after myself.

02:23.480 --> 02:26.310
I really think you picked
the wrong guy.

02:26.350 --> 02:29.350
Granted, there wasn't a big pool to pick from, but...

02:29.390 --> 02:33.840
I guess what
I'm trying to say is...

02:33.870 --> 02:36.530
I miss you, friend.

02:36.570 --> 02:38.080
What do you think
I should do?

02:38.120 --> 02:40.710
I mean, I-I --
I need a sign, man.

02:40.740 --> 02:43.370
You know,
maybe rattle some glasses

02:43.400 --> 02:47.510
if I should give him some space
or flicker the lights.

02:47.540 --> 02:51.650
You know, just a little flicker
if I should try harder.

02:51.680 --> 02:57.210
Any ghost-related stuff at all
would be great.

03:01.250 --> 03:02.830
Or nothing.

03:02.870 --> 03:04.490
Nothing works, too.

03:04.520 --> 03:06.220
[ Beeps ]

03:06.250 --> 03:13.330
♪♪

03:13.360 --> 03:20.400
♪♪

03:20.440 --> 03:23.090
[ Humming ]

03:26.170 --> 03:28.930
What the crap
are you doing?!

03:28.960 --> 03:30.690
KVN is making
helpful repairs.

03:30.720 --> 03:32.280
There! Boomtown!
No more hole.

03:32.310 --> 03:35.210
Hole?! That was the door
to the bathroom!

03:38.110 --> 03:40.910
Oh! I thought it was
a huge rectangular hole.

03:40.940 --> 03:42.390
Ugh!
How?!

03:42.420 --> 03:45.390
That huge rectangular hole was
the door to the bathroom!

03:45.430 --> 03:48.220
You sure?
Yes!
Yes, I'm -- Yes!

03:48.260 --> 03:51.300
[ Chuckles ] Well, that puts
you in a situation, huh?

03:51.330 --> 03:52.880
H.U.E.: Gary?
Yeah?

03:52.920 --> 03:54.920
I have news for you.What is it, H.U.E.?

03:54.950 --> 03:59.160
Three, two, one...

03:59.200 --> 04:02.410
Gary, your prison sentence
aboard the Galaxy 1

04:02.440 --> 04:03.650
is now complete.

04:03.690 --> 04:04.930
That's gre--
Wait, say what?

04:04.960 --> 04:06.590
You're free, Gary.

04:06.620 --> 04:07.830
Free?

04:07.860 --> 04:09.170
This isn't a joke?

04:09.210 --> 04:10.590
I mean,
I-I'm really free?

04:10.620 --> 04:14.560
Yes, Gary. What are you
going to do now?

04:14.590 --> 04:16.290
[ Munching ]

04:16.320 --> 04:18.810
Yes!
Oh, I'm free!

04:18.840 --> 04:20.740
All these long years,

04:20.770 --> 04:23.470
and these freedom cookies
are mine!

04:23.500 --> 04:24.980
[ Munching ]

04:26.640 --> 04:27.990
[ Clang! ]

04:29.540 --> 04:32.470
Gary? You should talk
to Little Cato.

04:33.060 --> 04:35.200
[ Grunting ]

04:37.380 --> 04:38.790
[ Grunts ]

04:38.830 --> 04:41.860
[ Panting ]

04:41.900 --> 04:44.450
[ Grunting ]

04:44.490 --> 04:46.870
"I think you need
to talk to Little Cato.

04:46.900 --> 04:48.700
I think you need to,
uh, crawl in a vent

04:48.730 --> 04:50.490
and talk to Little Cato."

04:55.500 --> 04:56.360
[ Screams ]

04:57.880 --> 04:59.160
[ Wheezes ]

04:59.190 --> 05:01.330
Hey, where'd you get
all those cookies?

05:01.370 --> 05:02.810
You want them?
They suck.

05:02.850 --> 05:04.540
They do.
They do suck.

05:04.580 --> 05:07.470
Five years for these little
round pieces of suckage!

05:07.510 --> 05:10.340
Get to the point.
I'm a busy guy.

05:10.370 --> 05:12.690
Well, hmm.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.830
All right, buddy,

05:13.860 --> 05:15.660
what can I do
to make you happy?

05:15.690 --> 05:17.480
Name anything.
Anything?

05:17.520 --> 05:19.490
Freakin' anything.
Anything?

05:19.520 --> 05:21.660
I just said freakin' anything.
Anything.

05:21.700 --> 05:25.490
Can you get me to
the Lord Commander?

05:25.530 --> 05:27.080
Okay.
Possibly.

05:27.110 --> 05:28.320
What do you want to do?

05:28.360 --> 05:30.390
I want to
slit his throat

05:30.430 --> 05:34.090
and splash
in his life juice.

05:35.230 --> 05:36.750
Oh. Good Lord,
that's dark.

05:36.780 --> 05:38.020
Okay, well...

05:38.060 --> 05:40.020
[ Chuckles ]
Sounds like a fantastic idea.

05:40.060 --> 05:41.410
Count me in!

05:41.440 --> 05:43.410
[ Laughs ] I never thought
I'd be creating

05:43.440 --> 05:47.410
a murder squad with
a small boy, but here we are.

05:48.580 --> 05:50.520
Is this...

05:50.550 --> 05:51.760
Is this my father's room?

05:51.790 --> 05:53.280
Hell yeah, it is.

05:55.970 --> 05:57.490
Oh, my gosh,
look at all the crap.

05:57.520 --> 05:59.700
All right, well, Avocato's
gotta have big boom sticks

05:59.730 --> 06:01.110
in here somewhere.

06:01.150 --> 06:02.940
What did
you think of him?
Your dad?

06:02.980 --> 06:05.390
Well, he was a short-tempered,
angry grouch.

06:05.430 --> 06:07.530
[ Chuckles ]
I loved that about him.

06:07.570 --> 06:09.880
Me, too.
Plus, he cared about you.

06:09.920 --> 06:11.950
Man, I mean,
more than anything.

06:11.990 --> 06:13.300
You think so?
I know so.

06:13.330 --> 06:14.540
He would never
shut up about you.

06:14.580 --> 06:16.030
I mean, every day,
"Little Cato --

06:16.060 --> 06:17.750
we gotta save Little Cato.
He's injured.

06:17.790 --> 06:19.930
He's my boy.
Let's find him."

06:19.960 --> 06:21.890
You know, I do not jest,
the man loved you.

06:21.930 --> 06:23.450
He never said that to me.

06:23.480 --> 06:26.210
He said it when
he gave his life to save you.

06:26.240 --> 06:28.940
That was love
in action mode --

06:28.970 --> 06:30.420
Avocato style.

06:30.450 --> 06:35.630
♪♪

06:35.670 --> 06:40.810
♪♪

06:40.840 --> 06:43.090
[ Rumbling ]

06:43.120 --> 06:45.920
Heck chicklets!
We got it!

06:45.950 --> 06:47.540
Here you go!
You ready?

06:47.570 --> 06:50.230
Let's tear the Lord Commander
a new butthole.

06:50.270 --> 06:52.170
Yes!
Maybe even three!

06:52.200 --> 06:53.890
Or four.
Four of them?

06:53.930 --> 06:56.830
10. 10 painfully
wide-open buttholes!

06:56.860 --> 06:59.240
We're gonna cover him
in buttholes.

06:59.280 --> 07:02.620
That's a -- that's, like, 50
to 55 buttholes right there!

07:02.660 --> 07:04.800
KVN wants to cover him
in buttholes, too!

07:04.830 --> 07:06.250
We're coming,
deal with it!

07:06.280 --> 07:08.350
All right, fine.
We shall be called

07:08.390 --> 07:09.770
the Legion of Murdering

07:09.800 --> 07:12.980
an Irritatingly
Power-thirsty Pint-sized Imp

07:13.010 --> 07:18.120
into a Plethora
of Butthoooooles!

07:18.160 --> 07:25.060
♪♪

07:27.550 --> 07:32.170
H.U.E.: Quinn, only 48 hours till the breach consumes Earth.

07:32.210 --> 07:33.520
Until we fix the ship,

07:33.550 --> 07:36.140
we cannot engage
our lightfold engines,

07:36.170 --> 07:39.280
and you have
a more immediate problem.

07:39.320 --> 07:41.530
H.U.E.,
what is he doing?

07:41.560 --> 07:43.460
I can only hypothesize,

07:43.490 --> 07:45.600
but I think they are
going to pick a fight.

07:45.630 --> 07:47.010
That idiot!

07:51.400 --> 07:53.020
Gary, we don't
have time for this!

07:53.050 --> 07:54.680
We've got bigger problems!

07:54.710 --> 07:56.230
Oh, right.
Tunes!

07:56.260 --> 07:57.780
[ Chuckles ]
Thanks, Quinn.

07:57.820 --> 07:59.230
H.U.E.,
play the good stuff.

07:59.270 --> 08:02.650
I'm talking about war trumpets,
rain sticks,

08:02.680 --> 08:04.510
soul-crushing crumhorns

08:04.550 --> 08:07.900
to stir the hearts
of these merry men.

08:07.930 --> 08:09.410
And piccolos and clarinets.

08:09.450 --> 08:11.140
No piccolos or clarinets!

08:11.180 --> 08:13.900
Right.
Angelic violins.No!

08:13.940 --> 08:15.800
[ Soft music plays ]

08:15.840 --> 08:17.320
Oh, H.U.E., what is this?

08:17.350 --> 08:19.560
The good stuff, Gary.That is not the good stuff!

08:19.600 --> 08:22.390
Where are the war trumpets,
the rain sticks?

08:22.430 --> 08:23.570
This is so sad, Gary.

08:23.600 --> 08:26.090
It makes me think about
all the people I've loved

08:26.120 --> 08:27.640
who have died, like --

08:27.670 --> 08:28.880
Don't -- Don't say it.

08:28.920 --> 08:31.920
Avocato.
Oh!
[ Sobbing ]

08:31.950 --> 08:35.920
My bro is dead!

08:35.960 --> 08:38.750
Can you take all of that
over there?

08:38.790 --> 08:40.410
Maybe I should.

08:40.450 --> 08:41.900
Sorry, small fry.

08:41.930 --> 08:44.450
I didn't foresee
my emotional shielding

08:44.480 --> 08:47.210
getting shut down
so quickly!

08:47.250 --> 08:49.870
[ Sobbing ]
Chookity!

08:49.900 --> 08:52.080
Shut the hell up,
Mooncake!

08:52.110 --> 08:55.530
[ Sobbing ]
Oh, I'm so sad!

08:55.560 --> 08:57.530
♪♪

08:57.570 --> 08:58.710
Little Cato,

08:58.740 --> 09:01.020
I am not detecting
the Lord Commander

09:01.050 --> 09:02.680
on that heavy incinerator.

09:02.710 --> 09:04.190
I don't care.

09:04.230 --> 09:06.400
This is for my dad!

09:09.510 --> 09:12.580
In hindsight, this wasn't
the greatest idea.

09:13.820 --> 09:14.790
[ Screams ]

09:14.830 --> 09:16.030
Quinn: What was that?!

09:16.070 --> 09:19.070
Gary, are you okay?
Gary? Gary?!

09:19.110 --> 09:21.280
Gary!
[ Screaming ]

09:21.310 --> 09:31.080
♪♪

09:31.120 --> 09:34.050
Oh, my audio processing unit.
I can't hear you.

09:34.090 --> 09:35.430
What, what?

09:35.470 --> 09:37.430
What, what?

09:37.470 --> 09:39.570
[ Engine rumbles ]

09:39.610 --> 09:43.890
♪♪

09:43.920 --> 09:45.370
[ Tone chimes ]

09:48.860 --> 09:50.590
[ Tone chimes ]

09:50.620 --> 09:56.180
♪♪

10:10.400 --> 10:11.850
[ Grunts ]

10:11.880 --> 10:14.130
Small fry?
Hey, wake up.

10:17.130 --> 10:19.580
[ Buzzes ]
Did you say something?

10:21.820 --> 10:23.310
[ Monitor beeping ]

10:23.340 --> 10:27.210
Avocato picked the worst guy
to watch over his son.

10:27.240 --> 10:31.110
I am a bad-luck magnet.[ Humming ]

10:31.140 --> 10:32.450
Is he breathing?

10:32.490 --> 10:36.530
Great news, guys.
Little Cato is breathing.

10:39.840 --> 10:41.880
You saved my life.

10:41.910 --> 10:43.430
Who are you?

10:45.610 --> 10:47.120
Hi, Gary.

10:47.160 --> 10:48.500
Quinn?!
Gary, I--

10:48.540 --> 10:49.400
[ Screams ]

10:49.440 --> 10:52.340
What the
tough titty wompas?

10:56.410 --> 10:57.690
Who are you?

10:57.720 --> 10:59.030
Wha?
I'm you.

10:59.070 --> 11:00.310
But you can't be me.

11:00.340 --> 11:02.970
I know that
because I'm already me.

11:03.000 --> 11:05.140
What?No, I'm really you,

11:05.180 --> 11:07.040
just from the future.

11:07.080 --> 11:08.520
Hey, future Quinn,
I'm KVN,

11:08.560 --> 11:11.420
Gary's deep-space insanity
avoidance companion.

11:11.460 --> 11:14.320
[ Chuckles ] We're just
the bestest of friends.

11:14.360 --> 11:16.360
Shut up, KVN.Good Lord, that's hot.

11:16.390 --> 11:18.910
But the two of us together,
isn't that a paradox?

11:18.950 --> 11:20.190
Shouldn't the universe
explode?

11:20.230 --> 11:21.230
Excellent question.

11:21.260 --> 11:22.540
Apparently not.

11:22.570 --> 11:23.890
Excellent answer.

11:23.920 --> 11:25.440
But...why?

11:25.470 --> 11:28.270
'Cause Einstein's a jerk.
How am I supposed to know?

11:29.480 --> 11:31.930
If it helps, you can call me
by my code name --

11:31.960 --> 11:33.620
Nightfall.
Nightfall?

11:33.650 --> 11:35.280
That's super lame.

11:35.310 --> 11:36.620
Did I come up with that?

11:36.660 --> 11:37.760
No.
He did.

11:37.800 --> 11:39.110
[ Laughs ]

11:39.140 --> 11:41.730
Quinns, Quinns, stop fighting
with yourselves.

11:41.770 --> 11:45.220
Gotta say, Gary,
I missed your wit.

11:45.250 --> 11:48.290
Wit?! He took Little Cato
on a stupid suicide mission!

11:48.320 --> 11:49.950
What's wrong with you?!

11:49.980 --> 11:52.020
You're a danger
to all of us.

11:52.050 --> 11:53.740
♪♪

11:53.780 --> 11:56.190
Don't disagree.
My best friend's dead.

11:56.230 --> 11:58.130
I almost got his son killed.

11:58.160 --> 11:59.890
Now that my
prison sentence is up,

11:59.920 --> 12:02.650
maybe it's a good time for me
and Mooncake to move on.

12:02.680 --> 12:05.240
A great time.

12:05.270 --> 12:07.860
All right then.
Peace out.

12:07.890 --> 12:09.450
Just gonna get my keys.

12:09.480 --> 12:11.280
Where the crap are my keys?

12:11.310 --> 12:14.280
Oh, oh, oh.
That's a few coins.

12:14.310 --> 12:16.210
Oh, yeah.
I-I don't have keys.

12:16.250 --> 12:17.970
Okay, well...

12:18.010 --> 12:19.630
Peace out again.

12:22.670 --> 12:24.320
Quinn, Gary can't leave.

12:24.360 --> 12:25.640
Let him do what he wants.

12:25.670 --> 12:28.290
Every time you go it alone,
it ends in failure.

12:28.330 --> 12:30.780
You need everyone
on this crew to succeed.

12:30.810 --> 12:33.060
Until you accept that,
you have no chance.

12:33.090 --> 12:35.750
But I don't need them --
especially Gary.

12:35.780 --> 12:37.580
He's impetuous,
irresponsible,

12:37.610 --> 12:39.440
and he takes nothing
seriously.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.130
Oh, yeah, I forgot.

12:41.170 --> 12:43.380
You haven't
figured it out yet.

12:48.210 --> 12:51.320
I guess it's plan "B."
Again.

12:53.350 --> 12:55.770
Her ship's
a freakin' time machine.

12:55.800 --> 12:57.460
I can save my dad.

12:57.500 --> 12:58.770
Did you just
call me dad?

12:58.810 --> 13:00.120
Did I just
call you what?

13:00.150 --> 13:02.160
H.U.E.:
You're really going?

13:02.190 --> 13:04.780
Surprised myself, frankly,
but it is what it is.

13:04.810 --> 13:07.330
H.U.E., where are
my civilian clothes?

13:07.370 --> 13:09.780
What will I do
when you're gone?

13:09.820 --> 13:11.680
You're my only friend,
Gary.

13:11.720 --> 13:13.170
Really?
What about KVN?

13:13.200 --> 13:15.820
KVN is a jag-off, Gary.
You know that.

13:15.860 --> 13:17.380
Yeah, I do know that,
actually.

13:17.410 --> 13:19.720
Yeah. KVN was sent just
to ruin everything he touches!

13:19.760 --> 13:21.000
He's the complete opposite
of Midas.

13:21.040 --> 13:22.350
Turdas -- That's KVN.

13:22.380 --> 13:24.380
One touch, everything in life
turns into

13:24.420 --> 13:26.390
one long, slender turd.

13:26.420 --> 13:27.350
[ Screams ]
Chocli!

13:27.390 --> 13:28.700
What -- how -- hey!

13:28.730 --> 13:30.010
Hello.
Hi.

13:30.050 --> 13:33.530
[ Chuckling ] You caught me
at a highly naked

13:33.570 --> 13:34.810
pantsless time.

13:34.840 --> 13:37.020
Chocli.
Buk, buk, buk.Dang it!

13:37.050 --> 13:39.540
Do you know how long it's been
since we've been together?

13:39.570 --> 13:40.820
Five, eight minutes.

13:40.850 --> 13:42.580
More like 20 years.

13:42.610 --> 13:44.890
I lost you.
My you.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.580
That sucks for your you.

13:46.610 --> 13:48.200
Wah!
Whoa!

13:48.240 --> 13:50.170
I'm on the mattress.
Good Lord, you are strong.

13:50.200 --> 13:52.830
Oh, this has been fantastic.
And you're crawling on top.

13:52.860 --> 13:54.380
Okay, wait, you know what,
I-I-I gotta say

13:54.410 --> 13:56.520
I'm more of
a wine and dine kind of lad.

13:56.550 --> 13:59.140
Even a cracker and some water
would go a long way with me,

13:59.180 --> 14:02.600
'cause I mean -- Can we please,
uh, get to the subject --

14:02.630 --> 14:05.600
the subject matter here is
that there's a Quinn thing!

14:05.630 --> 14:06.880
I am Quinn.

14:06.910 --> 14:08.880
I mean my Quinn.
Don't get me wrong.

14:08.910 --> 14:11.400
Tomorrow's Quinn is super hot
and freakishly strong,

14:11.430 --> 14:13.780
but in a more tomorrow's
freakishly strong

14:13.810 --> 14:15.400
and hot kind of way.

14:15.440 --> 14:16.330
[ Device chimes ]

14:16.370 --> 14:18.370
All right.
I got what I need.

14:18.400 --> 14:19.440
Goodbye, Gary.

14:20.890 --> 14:22.060
Energy cuffs?

14:22.100 --> 14:23.550
[ Chuckles ]
You are sassy.

14:23.580 --> 14:26.380
We're playing goodbye
with energy cuffs.

14:26.410 --> 14:28.350
What the hell
is going on here?!

14:28.380 --> 14:31.620
It seems like you walked into
a situation, Quinn,

14:31.660 --> 14:33.180
where the two of us --"Us?!"

14:33.210 --> 14:35.800
Oh, no, no, no, no!
This is not us.

14:35.840 --> 14:37.040
But she's you.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.600
He's right.No, he's not!

14:38.630 --> 14:39.940
I think I am.I am you.

14:39.980 --> 14:41.390
But I'm not doing that.

14:41.430 --> 14:44.910
This naked bed stuff
really wasn't much of a --

14:44.950 --> 14:46.920
Shut up, Gary!I'm confused.

14:46.950 --> 14:49.300
I am not.
I am strangely aroused.

14:49.330 --> 14:51.610
Me, too!
Didn't know that
could happen.

14:51.640 --> 14:52.890
Feels weird.

14:53.990 --> 14:55.100
Get over here!

14:55.130 --> 14:57.100
I was done anyway.

14:57.130 --> 14:59.650
Cut the crap, Nightfall.
I want answers.

14:59.690 --> 15:01.480
I was trying
to save the universe.

15:01.520 --> 15:03.240
By handcuffing Gary naked?

15:03.280 --> 15:05.590
I don't want him to see
what's happening next.

15:05.620 --> 15:06.380
[ Beeps ]

15:06.420 --> 15:07.490
[ Grunting ]

15:07.520 --> 15:09.080
I'm going to kill Mooncake

15:09.110 --> 15:10.940
before he destroys
all of us.

15:10.970 --> 15:12.600
What are you
talking about?

15:12.630 --> 15:15.840
Do you know what's about
to happen to Gary?

15:15.880 --> 15:17.840
Every time Gary
leaves the mission,

15:17.880 --> 15:19.980
the Lord Commander
kills him.

15:20.020 --> 15:22.470
Something inside Mooncake
snaps.

15:22.500 --> 15:24.300
Mooncake lays waste
to the universe

15:24.330 --> 15:27.130
and tears open the door
to Final Space.

15:27.160 --> 15:29.480
That's when the Titans
break through the barrier

15:29.510 --> 15:32.170
to our dimension.

15:32.200 --> 15:34.270
Monstrous nightmares.

15:34.310 --> 15:37.140
Words are a waste
describing their horror.

15:37.170 --> 15:38.830
[ Titans snarling ]

15:38.860 --> 15:40.490
Stop.
You can't do this.

15:40.520 --> 15:42.140
You'll thank me
in the end.

15:42.180 --> 15:43.940
[ Footsteps clanging ]

15:44.970 --> 15:45.970
[ Grunts ]

15:46.010 --> 15:47.250
Chocli -- agh!
[ Screams ]

15:47.290 --> 15:48.530
Mooncake!
Chocli, buk, buk!

15:48.560 --> 15:49.810
[ Grunts ]
Mooncake!

15:49.840 --> 15:50.880
Buk, buk, buk!

15:50.910 --> 15:52.430
[ Grunting ]

15:52.460 --> 15:55.190
[ Groaning ]
If I can just...

15:57.640 --> 15:59.990
Yes!

16:00.020 --> 16:01.470
Nightfall wants
to kill Mooncake!

16:01.510 --> 16:03.130
I can see that!
Get me out of here!

16:03.160 --> 16:05.300
We need to stop her
right now!

16:05.340 --> 16:06.680
[ High-pitched ]
A little close!

16:06.720 --> 16:08.030
Get dressed!
Let's go!

16:08.070 --> 16:09.000
This last day sucks!

16:09.030 --> 16:10.100
Chocli!
Chocli!

16:10.140 --> 16:11.280
No!
[ Grunts ]

16:11.310 --> 16:12.520
Chocli!

16:12.550 --> 16:13.520
Chocli!

16:13.550 --> 16:14.830
Chocli!

16:14.870 --> 16:16.110
Chocli, choc, choc, choc!

16:16.140 --> 16:18.110
Choc, choc, choc!

16:18.140 --> 16:20.080
[ Buzzing ]

16:23.910 --> 16:25.050
Why would you want
to kill Mooncake?

16:25.080 --> 16:26.570
I don't!
Ow!

16:28.050 --> 16:29.640
She does.

16:29.670 --> 16:38.820
♪♪

16:38.850 --> 16:40.580
[ Whirring ]

16:41.720 --> 16:43.890
[ Voice breaking ]
I'm proud of you, son.

16:43.930 --> 16:45.170
[ Normal voice ]
Why am I crying?

16:45.210 --> 16:47.170
Oh, you're growing up
so fast.

16:47.210 --> 16:48.900
I'm sorry, I'm just
going on and on.

16:48.930 --> 16:50.210
Stop it.
You're not my dad.

16:50.250 --> 16:52.140
'Cause I'm better
than your dad, right?

16:52.180 --> 16:54.220
It's okay. You can admit it,
you can say yes.

16:54.250 --> 16:55.390
Go ahead.
No!

16:55.420 --> 16:56.870
Can I be
your granddad?
No.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.010
Grandpa?
No.

16:58.050 --> 16:58.870
Uncle?
No.

16:58.910 --> 16:59.670
Cousin?
No.

16:59.700 --> 17:00.530
Nephew?
No.

17:00.570 --> 17:01.530
Brother?
No.

17:01.570 --> 17:02.780
Can I be
your great-granddad?
No.

17:02.810 --> 17:03.740
Can I be your aunt?
No.

17:03.780 --> 17:04.740
Can I be your niece?
No.

17:04.780 --> 17:05.850
Can I be your...mom?

17:05.880 --> 17:06.780
No, no.

17:06.810 --> 17:08.540
[ Grunting ]

17:08.570 --> 17:15.240
♪♪

17:15.270 --> 17:17.790
Whoa, look at all
these cosmic ice cubes!

17:17.820 --> 17:19.070
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

17:19.100 --> 17:21.240
Oh! [ Laughs ]
Whoa, whoa!

17:21.280 --> 17:23.520
Oh!
Whoa, cool!

17:23.550 --> 17:28.080
♪♪

17:28.110 --> 17:29.560
[ Beeping ]

17:31.600 --> 17:32.600
[ Beeping ]

17:32.630 --> 17:34.600
[ Rings ]

17:34.630 --> 17:35.570
Mooncake!

17:37.120 --> 17:39.290
Whoa, not cool!

17:39.330 --> 17:41.090
You've gotta go through me
to get to him.

17:41.120 --> 17:42.640
[ Beeping ]

17:42.680 --> 17:47.920
♪♪

17:47.960 --> 17:49.790
You don't want
to do this.

17:49.820 --> 17:51.480
Trust me.

17:51.510 --> 17:52.450
Trust Gary.

17:54.140 --> 17:56.280
♪♪

17:56.310 --> 17:58.240
Quinn, tell Gary
what happens.

17:58.280 --> 18:00.280
Tell him why we need
to kill Mooncake.

18:00.320 --> 18:01.770
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm,
okay.

18:01.800 --> 18:03.110
Really lost in the weeds
over here.

18:03.150 --> 18:05.800
Anybody mind whacking
some clarity for me?

18:05.840 --> 18:07.460
Tell him!

18:07.500 --> 18:09.390
KVN:
Can I be your twin?Little Cato: No.

18:09.430 --> 18:10.640
Can I be
your anything?
No, no, no.

18:10.670 --> 18:12.120
Can I be
your everything?
No.

18:12.160 --> 18:13.260
Can I be you?
No.

18:13.290 --> 18:14.400
I want to be you.

18:14.430 --> 18:16.610
I want to be you!

18:16.640 --> 18:18.820
[ Beeping ] Self-destruct imminent.

18:18.850 --> 18:20.960
Time fusion chamber leaking.

18:20.990 --> 18:23.990
No, no, no, no, no!
Wait, what is happening?

18:24.030 --> 18:25.170
We're trapped.

18:25.200 --> 18:27.410
Ugh!
This is gonna end bad.

18:27.450 --> 18:28.690
What is going on, Quinn?

18:28.720 --> 18:31.280
If you leave,
the Lord Commander kills you,

18:31.310 --> 18:34.110
and Mooncake takes revenge
on everything.

18:34.140 --> 18:36.700
And I mean everything.

18:36.730 --> 18:38.600
I've been back
hundreds of times,

18:38.630 --> 18:41.980
and the only option left
is to kill Mooncake.

18:42.010 --> 18:42.940
Little buddy?

18:42.980 --> 18:44.640
[ Beeping ]H.U.E.: Emergency.

18:44.670 --> 18:48.290
Little Cato is trapped
inside Nightfall's ship.

18:48.330 --> 18:50.120
He triggered
the self-destruct!

18:50.160 --> 18:51.440
It can't be turned off!

18:51.470 --> 18:52.680
Little Cato.

18:52.710 --> 18:55.060
Please.
For me.

18:55.090 --> 18:56.960
I can't let him die.

18:56.990 --> 18:58.820
[ Sighs ]

18:58.860 --> 19:01.380
Mooncake, let's go!Mooncake:
Chocli-bop!

19:02.210 --> 19:03.860
[ Grunting ]

19:03.900 --> 19:05.000
Help!

19:05.040 --> 19:08.280
♪ The winds of change
keep blowing ♪

19:08.310 --> 19:11.460
♪ We're all gonna die

19:11.490 --> 19:18.570
♪♪

19:18.600 --> 19:20.570
♪ Winds of change keep...

19:20.600 --> 19:22.120
[ Grunting ]

19:26.370 --> 19:27.750
♪ Don't let me go

19:27.780 --> 19:29.850
♪ Never let me go

19:29.890 --> 19:32.200
♪ Never let... We've gotta get them out.
Time is leaking.

19:32.240 --> 19:34.750
In another moment, they'll be
blinked out of existence.

19:34.790 --> 19:37.520
♪ No, never let me go

19:38.550 --> 19:41.040
[ Singing indistinctly ]

19:41.070 --> 19:42.180
Little Cato!

19:45.390 --> 19:47.940
Grab my hand!

19:47.970 --> 19:50.700
[ Voice breaking ]
It was all my fault.

19:50.740 --> 19:52.360
He died because of me.

19:52.390 --> 19:54.020
I said grab it!

19:54.050 --> 19:59.020
♪♪

19:59.050 --> 20:00.440
[ Grunts ]

20:07.410 --> 20:10.130
[ Sobbing ]
I feel so alone.

20:10.170 --> 20:11.410
You're not alone.

20:11.450 --> 20:13.380
We'll get through it together.

20:13.410 --> 20:15.210
As a team.

20:15.240 --> 20:16.420
As a squad.

20:16.450 --> 20:18.450
As a team squad.

20:18.490 --> 20:19.770
How?
You're leaving.

20:19.800 --> 20:21.970
To be honest, I was never
going anywhere.

20:22.010 --> 20:23.800
I mean, I --
I got nowhere to go.

20:23.840 --> 20:26.430
H.U.E.: Hell yeah, dawg.

20:26.460 --> 20:28.220
Give Mooncake
one more chance.

20:28.260 --> 20:29.570
I can fix this.

20:29.600 --> 20:32.430
Gary, I'm...
glad you're sticking around.

20:32.470 --> 20:33.570
Why?

20:33.610 --> 20:36.610
Because I need you.To do what?

20:36.640 --> 20:38.270
I just need you, okay?
So shut up!

20:38.300 --> 20:39.610
Works for me.

20:39.650 --> 20:42.370
[ Sniffles ]
What about me?
You, too.

20:42.410 --> 20:44.580
Chocli-pop?And especially you.

20:44.620 --> 20:45.790
What the hell, Quinn?

20:45.830 --> 20:47.410
You failed to mention me.

20:47.450 --> 20:49.280
Yes, you.Hi, what about KVN?

20:49.310 --> 20:51.110
Do you need KVN?
Huh?

20:51.140 --> 20:52.380
Huh?Yes, KVN!

20:52.420 --> 20:54.770
Yes, KVN, what?

20:54.800 --> 20:58.110
I need you, too, all right?
I need all of you.

20:58.150 --> 21:00.810
Then you just joined the
Legion of Murdering...

21:00.840 --> 21:02.290
something or another.

21:02.330 --> 21:03.570
I don't know.
It's really long.

21:03.600 --> 21:04.780
Yeah, you did.

21:04.810 --> 21:06.430
I hope that's enough.

21:06.470 --> 21:12.270
♪♪

21:12.300 --> 21:18.060
♪♪
